:: MP Loc Forest More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
界石旁那块木板翻了个面：正面六格记排好日子的常规活，背面钉着十枚发亮的铁钉，每枚底下压着一样急事的记号。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>把炭条搁在木板下沿，说急事不挑天气，也不等人把活做完。木板按脚程分作三路：近处猎径与营地，深处旧迹与炭窑，夜里的雾线与灯桩；先走哪一路，由你定。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpmapicon>><<link [[走猎径营地 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Trail]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[进林深处探旧迹 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Deep]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<lanternicon>><<link [[查夜雾与灯线 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Night]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<link [[查看当季林活 (0:03)|MP Loc Forest Season Extra]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<link [[当季整备活计 (0:03)|MP Loc Forest Season Extra 2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest More2 Trail [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
猎径沿灯线往北，穿过桦树线和中段缓坡。老椴树的蜂群在晌午分团，倒木横在唯一干爽的路面上，第五盏灯下的溪水改了道，路心还长着一圈正圆的菌子。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>把营地扎在能看见第三根灯桩的地方，说这一路的事多半是人不肯低头才撞上的。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<link [[重立狼界桩 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Event 11]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpDone_Forest_13>>蜂群已迁进新箱。<br><<else>><<mpanimalicon>><<link [[看野蜂迁巢 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Event 13]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Forest_14>>断木已经让开了路。<br><<else>><<mpcarryicon>><<link [[搬开挡路断木 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Event 14]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Forest_17>>溪水被引回旧道。<br><<else>><<mpwatchicon>><<link [[引溪水回旧河道 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Event 17]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Forest_20>>菌圈的事已经弄清。<<else>><<link [[查清路心菌圈异象 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Event 20]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Loc Forest More2 Deep [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
林深处少有人走。旧炭窑的竖坑通着塌掉的风道，北坡岩窝里留着猎人的火塘，兽径上埋着落木和细网。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>说越往里走，越要先看脚下，再看树上；被逼到墙角的人，比狼更敢下手。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<link [[伊甸的柴屋 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Event 12]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpDone_Forest_15>>坑里的狼崽已经脱身。<br><<else>><<mpanimalicon>><<link [[救阱中狼崽 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Event 15]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Forest_18>>岩窝的火塘已经熄净。<br><<else>><<mpwatchicon>><<link [[查看猎人火塘 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Event 18]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Forest_21>>兽径上的机关已经拆清。<<else>><<mpcarryicon>><<link [[查清偷猎的陷阱 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Event 21]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Loc Forest More2 Night [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
灯线往北岭去的一段夜里最不安生。落叶松林半夜惊起鸟群，第七根灯桩旁的老橡被干雷劈裂，雾一起就有人在林子里喊。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>说这一段先看灯，再看风，最后才应声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpDone_Forest_16>>灯线下的鸟群已经落定。<<else>><<lanternicon>><<link [[查半夜鸟群 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Event 16]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<if $mpDone_Forest_19>>老橡的火气已经压住。<<else>><<link [[查看雷劈老橡 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Event 19]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<if $mpDone_Forest_22>>雾里的呼救已经有了着落。<<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[循声查雾中呼救 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Event 22]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 13 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
老椴树洞的蜂群在晌午炸了团，黑压压挂在第三根灯桩的横枝上，离灯罩不到一臂。<<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>背蜜罐的邻户<</if>>把陶罐搁在石头上，说烟比水好使。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>拖出缺角的旧蜂箱，推到你脚边。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[循蜂舞找巢 (0:14)|MP Loc Forest Event 13 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpForestEv13 to "ok">><<money 30>><<tiredness 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv13 to "fail">><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpbargainicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 25>><<link [[烟熏移走整群蜂 (0:10)|MP Loc Forest Event 13 After]]>><<pass 10>><<money -25>><<set $mpForestEv13 to "ok">><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">烟熏移走整群蜂 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 13 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpForestEv13 is "fail">>蜂团在半空炸开，追着你的脸和手蜇。你护着头退到灯桩下，脚背撞上树根，肿起一小块。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>把湿草压灭，摇着头说这一团今天收不回去了。白烟散进林子。<<else>>蜂群终于安静下来，不再围着灯桩打转。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>把旧蜂箱挪到背风向阳的墙根，说这一窝算是安顿下来了。割下的蜜换了几个铜板。林子里重新安静下来，只剩蜂翅的低鸣。<<if !$mpDone_Forest_13>><<set $mpDone_Forest_13 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0) + 1)>><</if>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回森林总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 14 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
后半夜的干风把一棵两人合抱的山毛榉连根翻倒，横在唯一干爽的路面上，坡下积水正往回流。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>扛着横锯，说粗木能换盐；<<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>推车的邻户<</if>>扶着车辕，只说路等不起。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[锯断横倒木 (0:16)|MP Loc Forest Event 14 After]]>><<pass 16>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpForestEv14 to "ok">><<money 35>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -1>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv14 to "fail">><<stress 3>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[搭一座临时便桥 (0:14)|MP Loc Forest Event 14 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($tending or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpForestEv14 to "ok">><<stress -2>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv14 to "fail">><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 14 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpForestEv14 is "fail">>活干到一半，坡上的水又漫过来，脚下的土松得站不住。你退得急，脚踝在石棱上磕了一下，断木仍旧横在路心。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>把工具收了，说今天这趟算是白费力气，只能等水退。<<else>>断木旁终于让出一条能走的路，车马不必再绕远。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>把粗料码到手车旁，说这一趟够换几天的盐。坡下的水退了一线。路面踩实以后，车辙总算不再打滑。<<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>推车的邻户<</if>>点点头。<<if !$mpDone_Forest_14>><<set $mpDone_Forest_14 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0) + 1)>><</if>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回森林总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 15 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
天刚亮，老炭窑的竖坑里传来狼崽短促的叫。它扒着滑壁往上蹿，一次次摔回落叶。黑狼站在坡脊的松树间，尾巴垂着。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>说不能直接跳下去抱。<<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>溪边的邻户<</if>>放下麻绳，让你自己拿主意。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpanimalicon>><<link [[下坑抱狼崽 (0:14)|MP Loc Forest Event 15 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpForestEv15 to "ok">><<if mpNpcMet("Black Wolf")>><<npcincr "Black Wolf" love 1>><</if>><<stress -2>><<pain 1>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv15 to "fail">><<stress 4>><<pain 3>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[削缓坡引它上来 (0:16)|MP Loc Forest Event 15 After]]>><<pass 16>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpForestEv15 to "ok">><<if mpNpcMet("Black Wolf")>><<npcincr "Black Wolf" love 1>><</if>><<stress -2>><<tiredness 2>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv15 to "fail">><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 15 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpForestEv15 is "fail">>坑壁的土一抠就掉渣，你脚下一滑，半个人陷进碎炭里。狼崽受惊往坑底缩，叫声变得尖利。黑狼在坡脊上站了起来。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>拉住你的后领，把你拖回坑沿。<<else>>狼崽终于出了坑，落地就钻进灌木，回头看了你一眼。坡脊的黑狼低下头，慢慢退回松林。坑底的落叶被风掀起。坑口的风慢慢停了，林子重新有了虫鸣。<<if !$mpDone_Forest_15>><<set $mpDone_Forest_15 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0) + 1)>><</if>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回森林总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 16 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
入夜后鸟群从落叶松林里一波波炸起，压着树梢往溪那边去。灯罩积了薄灰，火苗比黄昏时小。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>说翅膀撞翻火苗最麻烦。<<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>从深层上来的邻户<</if>>说惊飞的方向一直往北偏，像有人踩着石头过溪。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[守鸟群归枝 (0:14)|MP Loc Forest Event 16 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or ($tending or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpForestEv16 to "ok">><<stress -2>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv16 to "fail">><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<lanternicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 20>><<link [[掏钱添油稳灯线 (0:10)|MP Loc Forest Event 16 After]]>><<pass 10>><<money -20>><<set $mpForestEv16 to "ok">><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">掏钱添油稳灯线 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 16 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpForestEv16 is "fail">>你在灯下守了半宿，鸟群却越飞越散，最后连零星几声也听不见了。雾水顺着领口往里渗，腿站得发木。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>把油壶收回去，说今夜按不住了，先别再把灯芯耗空。<<else>>灯线终于稳住了，鸟群在半空绕了两圈，先落低枝，再一层层回到树冠。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>数着落枝的方向，说这一夜算是按住了。雾里只剩零星几声回应。灯罩里的火苗重新立直，照着脚下的土路。<<if !$mpDone_Forest_16>><<set $mpDone_Forest_16 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0) + 1)>><</if>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回森林总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 17 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
连下三天的雨把溪水喂饱，水从塌掉的土坎拐弯，直切灯桩坡脚。月牙缺口又宽了一指。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>说要么引回旧道，要么给坡脚穿甲。<<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>小屋那边来的邻户<</if>>说门前柴堆已泡透，屋后的柳条可以拿来护岸。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[垒石引旧道 (0:16)|MP Loc Forest Event 17 After]]>><<pass 16>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpForestEv17 to "ok">><<stress -2>><<tiredness 2>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv17 to "fail">><<stress 3>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[编柳笼护住坡脚 (0:14)|MP Loc Forest Event 17 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpForestEv17 to "ok">><<if $NPCName and mpNpcMet("Eden")>><<npcincr Eden trust 1>><</if>><<stress -2>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv17 to "fail">><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 17 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpForestEv17 is "fail">>水比预想的急，刚压下去的一段又被冲开，泥浆溅了你一身。你踩进松软的坡脚，膝盖磕在石上，裤脚全湿。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>把你拉上来，说今天水太急，得等它退一退。<<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>小屋那边来的邻户<</if>>摇着头，把工具收了回去。<<else>>缺口终于被堵住，水顺着旧道走，坡脚的土重新露出来。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>把剩下的料码好，说这一段能撑到入秋。<<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>小屋那边来的邻户<</if>>把工具收拢，说门前那片地总算保住了。夜里的灯线这一段总算接上了。<<if !$mpDone_Forest_17>><<set $mpDone_Forest_17 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0) + 1)>><</if>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回森林总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 18 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
深层北坡飘来一股烧透的松脂味。岩窝里九块石头围成火塘，灰还温着，旁边三双靴印，一双后跟钉了铁掌。灰堆边有枚黄铜弹壳。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>说先看清退路；<<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>背枪的邻户<</if>>说火塘离枯杉不到三十步。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[压土熄火 (0:12)|MP Loc Forest Event 18 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($sneak or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpForestEv18 to "ok">><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv18 to "fail">><<stress 4>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[留暗记警告 (0:10)|MP Loc Forest Event 18 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpForestEv18 to "ok">><<tiredness 1>><<stress -1>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv18 to "fail">><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 18 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpForestEv18 is "fail">>事没办利落，坡脊上的枯枝声忽然停了，接着是脚步散开的声音。你退得急，被岩窝边的石棱绊了一下，烟呛得直咳。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>把你拽离火塘，说今晚不能再待。<<else>>火塘彻底凉了下去，灰堆塌成平平的一层，没有再冒白烟。你在旁边插了一根折成十字的树枝。坡脊上的枯枝响了一声，随后安静下来。风从岩窝上方灌下来，烟已经散尽了。<<if !$mpDone_Forest_18>><<set $mpDone_Forest_18 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0) + 1)>><</if>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回森林总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 19 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
傍晚的干雷劈中北岭那棵老橡，树干从树冠裂到根，裂口深处泛着暗红。焦皮味顺着风飘下来。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>说雷火会顺着树心钻进根里。<<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>提桶的邻户<</if>>拎着两桶水从溪边上来，说水能压住明火，要断根还得开隔离带。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[提水浇裂缝 (0:14)|MP Loc Forest Event 19 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpForestEv19 to "ok">><<stress -2>><<tiredness 2>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv19 to "fail">><<stress 3>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[砍出一条隔离带 (0:16)|MP Loc Forest Event 19 After]]>><<pass 16>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 0) gte 11000>><<set $mpForestEv19 to "ok">><<stress -2>><<tiredness 2>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv19 to "fail">><<stress 3>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 2>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 19 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpForestEv19 is "fail">>火没压住，裂缝里又冒出一串火星，落进还没清干净的苔里。你扑过去拍打，手背被烫了一下，烟熏得睁不开眼。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>把你拉开，说这棵树今天碰不得，得等一场透雨。<<else>>火势终于被压住，裂缝里的暗红慢慢暗下去，没有再冒火星。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>用靴底碾了碾焦苔，说这一夜能守住。风从坡下上来，带着湿土的味道。焦皮的味道淡下去，林子重新有了虫鸣。<<if !$mpDone_Forest_19>><<set $mpDone_Forest_19 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0) + 1)>><</if>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回森林总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 20 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
中段最平的苔地上，菌子长成一个直径六七步的正圆。圈里草矮色深，圈心没有兽蹄印。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>挑起一朵菌，说这底下多半被人翻过。<<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>坡上下来的邻户<</if>>说早年烧炭坑填平后，圈心底下或许埋着锡盒和旧铜板。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[挖开菌圈心 (0:16)|MP Loc Forest Event 20 After]]>><<pass 16>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpForestEv20 to "ok">><<money 45>><<tiredness 2>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv20 to "fail">><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[采圈边褐菌换钱 (0:12)|MP Loc Forest Event 20 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpForestEv20 to "ok">><<money 25>><<stress -2>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv20 to "fail">><<stress 3>><<pain 2>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 20 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpForestEv20 is "fail">>你蹲得太久，起身时眼前一黑，脚下一软，压坏了圈边一片白伞。圈心的土被你踩塌了一角，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>皱着眉把土重新掩上。他说这圈菌子明年怕是不会再长成圆了。<<else>>你把这圈菌子料理妥当，能采的装袋，圈心的土重新掩平。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>说这圈菌子明年还会长。换来的铜板揣进怀里。圈边的苔皮重新铺平，踩上去不再发空。<<if !$mpDone_Forest_20>><<set $mpDone_Forest_20 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0) + 1)>><</if>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回森林总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 21 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
两块大石之间的兽径上，一根圆木压住了獾的后腿。触发棒削得干净，绳结偏左，是熟手。坡上十几步，细网挂着一只不动的鸫鸟。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>说整条兽径都得摸清。<<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>腰后带刀的邻户<</if>>说抬圆木要先垫石。坡脊的黑狼站着没走。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[拆落木活阱 (0:16)|MP Loc Forest Event 21 After]]>><<pass 16>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpForestEv21 to "ok">><<money 25>><<tiredness 2>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv21 to "fail">><<stress 3>><<pain 3>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpanimalicon>><<link [[放走阱中被困兽 (0:12)|MP Loc Forest Event 21 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpForestEv21 to "ok">><<if mpNpcMet("Black Wolf")>><<npcincr "Black Wolf" love 1>><</if>><<stress -2>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv21 to "fail">><<stress 3>><<pain 2>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 21 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpForestEv21 is "fail">>圆木一歪，獾回头就是一口，牙咬穿了你的手套。你抽手后退，触发棒弹开，圆木砸在石上。细网被挣断，鸫鸟掉进蕨丛。坡脊上的黑狼退进了林子。你捏着手腕，没再上前。<<else>>圆木终于被抬开，獾抽回后腿，迟疑了一瞬，钻进坡下的蕨丛。你割开细网，把死鸫放下来。坡脊的黑狼看着这边，没有靠近。风把网绳吹得轻响。兽径重新空出来，风从坡上直穿过去。<<if !$mpDone_Forest_21>><<set $mpDone_Forest_21 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0) + 1)>><</if>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回森林总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 22 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
午后的雾从谷底翻上来，先淹溪，再淹路。雾里有人喊：「有人吗。」声音不远，走几步又像从左边来。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>按住你的肩，说雾会折声。<<if mpNpcMet("Eden")>>伊甸<<else>>从灯线来的邻户<</if>>说真迷路的人会自己靠近，喊声停在原地就得留心。坡脊的黑狼嗅了嗅地，退进雾里。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[应声摸过去 (0:14)|MP Loc Forest Event 22 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or ($tending or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpForestEv22 to "ok">><<money 20>><<stress -2>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv22 to "fail">><<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[绕到上风口再看 (0:16)|MP Loc Forest Event 22 After]]>><<pass 16>><<if ($sneak or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpForestEv22 to "ok">><<stress -2>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<set $mpForestEv22 to "fail">><<stress 3>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Event 22 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpForestEv22 is "fail">>雾里的声音忽远忽近，你辨错了方向，一脚踩进倒木旁的洼地。膝盖磕在石头上，喊声却忽然停了。雾里传来一声轻笑，随后是脚步退远的声音。你扶着树站起来，才发现自己离灯线已经很远。<<else>>你辨清了声音的来处，在倒木后找到一个脚踝扭伤的老猎人。他冻得说不出整句，你扶他绕到上风口，慢慢挪回灯线。他塞来几枚铜板，你没多问。雾还没散，但脚下的路已经认得了。<<if !$mpDone_Forest_22>><<set $mpDone_Forest_22 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0) + 1)>><</if>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回森林总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Forest Season Extra 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest to ($mpLocEvents_Forest or 0)>>
续册最后夹着一页粗纸，记的是不值钱、缺一回就整季难受的活。<<if Time.season is "spring">>雪化后蜂箱返潮，界桩也松了，融雪水堵在旧沟。<<elseif Time.season is "summer">>连晴的日子正好补棚顶，烂横档要换，湿苔要刮。<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">>熏房积灰，火道不通；麻绳磨毛，果木枝还湿着。<<elseif Time.season is "winter">>雪压灯绳，灯罩烟灰冻硬，油壶也结了凝。<<else>>这个时节不上不下，松绳、磨刃、归置工具。<</if>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>今天有雨，只能在棚下做细活。<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "snow">>雪把散落的工具埋了，出门前得清点。<<else>>日头正好，绳具油布都该摊开见光。<</if>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>说这些活没人喝彩，少了哪样，往后都要加倍还。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[动手做整备 (0:12)|MP Loc Forest Season Extra 2 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($athletics or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpForestSeasonOk to 1>><<money 20>><<stress -2>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<set $mpForestSeasonOk to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpbargainicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 120>><<link [[出钱添置节令物 (0:08)|MP Loc Forest Season Extra 2 After]]>><<pass 8>><<money -120>><<set $mpForestSeasonOk to 1>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">出钱添置节令物 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Forest Season Extra 2 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpForestSeasonOk is 1>>你按着当季的规矩，把棚顶、绳具和灯罩一件件料理妥当。换下来的旧绳和铁件归到一处，<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>说攒够一包能换盐。林子里没有谁夸你，可手边的活都顺手了。<<if !$mpForestSeasonDone>><<set $mpForestSeasonDone to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Forest += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Forest to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Forest or 0) + 1)>><</if>><<else>>天色说变就变，风把摊开的麻绳吹进泥里，刚刮净的棚苔又淋湿了。你忙着收捡，脚下打滑，肩膀撞在棚柱上。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.ash and $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>林务员<</if>>说整备的活不怕慢，就怕赶。你蹲在棚下喘了一会儿。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林务续册 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回森林总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Forest Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
